# The parent storage/app/.gitignore excludes everything with a bare `*`, and a
# re-included directory does not re-include what is inside it — so each content
# folder needs its contents named explicitly.
#
# These are site content: the seeders reference these exact filenames and the
# site renders broken images without them.
!committee/
!committee/**
!events/
!events/**
!gallery/
!gallery/**

# Anything a registrant uploads is personal data and never goes to git.
registrations/
